  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 897b88ccbd92f9f49a100f3de1cabf0e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tips
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TipsDataSO
  Tips:
  - Collect scrap from barrels and enemies
  - You can shoot, bash and melee
  - You can place navigational markers to mark the way back
  - The green water isn't safe to drink, not like you can drink anyway
  - The big car enemy will rush at you, pinning you to the wall
  - Good robot, keep it up
  - I don't have infinite resources to keep making you
  - You are my only hope out of this place
  - Sometimes levers are hidden in the rooms
  - You can crush enemies with the doors and yourself too
  - You have a limit to how much scrap you can carry
  - Find upgrade cards to harvest upgrade modules from
  - Sometimes I regret making you
  - You can be profitable at times
  - Make me proud
  - I have a mission I must complete, that's why you're here
  - The firewall is the only thing stopping us
  - Once you feel that you are strong enough, challenge the firewall
  - Watch out of TODs, they are pack robots
  - Brarrels drop scrap once broken
  - BRONZE has the lowest, SILVER has medium, and GOLD has the most
  - Shoot the enemies, or melee them, what ever works
  - I fear I put too much trust into you
  - Machine, stay focused on the task at hand
  - KILL, KILL, KILL
  - Do you have feelings?\nYou shouldn't!
  - Don't feel bad for killing their kind, they're just in the way
  - Is this mission even possible to complete?
